<title>USA: HFS ends license deal with AMRE.</title>
<headline>HFS ends license deal with AMRE.</headline>
<dateline>PARSIPPANY, N.J. 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>HFS Inc, a consumer services company, said on Friday it terminated AMRE Inc's license agreement to use the name CENTURY 21 HOME IMPROVEMENTS.</p>
<p>AMRE, a Dallas-based direct sale and marketing company for siding, windows, coating and kitchen cabinet products, announced on January 17 that it filed for Chapter 11 protection under the federal bankruptcy laws.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
